<item><title>Kiir ends emergency rule in four South Sudan states</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/kiir-ends-emergency-rule-in-four-south-sudan-states-c9e22c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/kiir-ends-emergency-rule-in-four-south-sudan-states-c9e22c/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>The order restores ordinary duties to state and national institutions, while an analyst says the emergency failed to stop violence.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Somalia to start issuing EAC e-passport in January, ahead of South Sudan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/somalia-to-start-issuing-eac-e-passport-in-january-ahead-of-aed99f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/somalia-to-start-issuing-eac-e-passport-in-january-ahead-of-aed99f/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>Somalia will become the latest East African Community partner state to issue the regional travel document, and South Sudan has yet to begin.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:53:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
