<item><title>Doctors&apos; charity spotlights four-hour walk for South Sudan rape survivor</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/doctors-charity-spotlights-four-hour-walk-for-south-sudan-c0aeb2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/doctors-charity-spotlights-four-hour-walk-for-south-sudan-c0aeb2/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>A woman identified as Nyawura said she walked to a health facility the morning after armed men raped her on her way home.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:20:32 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" length="35634" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ss.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
